{"parse": {"title": "再会在新世界-08", "pageid": 142064, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-07\" title=\"再会在新世界-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">再会在新世界-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">再会在新世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.89.80.E6.9C.89.E6.88.91.E7.88.B1.E7.9A.84.E4.BA.BA.E5.84.BF.E5.95.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"所有我爱的人儿啊\">所有我爱的人儿啊</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 所有我爱的人儿啊</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Please Watch over Us</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我想这件事一定给了她很大的打击……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏林以东摇了摇头，十分哀戚地捧着手上的画稿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我仍然记得她给当地人画的那些住房设计，虽然我不懂建筑学，但我觉得那些房子住进去一定会很舒服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>而这些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>我说过！这个女人一定不是什么建筑师，她所有的设计都是别人代笔的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>哦，这听上去很不好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>万一奠基石赶在那些著名的建筑师出生之前，把他们所有的代表作都“设计”好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>这对人类来说一定是很糟糕的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嘿，我好像听到有人在聚众制造关于我的谣言？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>亚肖，好久不见！看样子这些“2000年未来主义”的概念设计比我更先见到了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>我完全看不懂。我很担心你是不是受了什么刺激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>比如说……我不知道为什么你要用这种强调立体感的、巨大的、彩虹渐变色的手法去设计字体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>这对我的眼睛很不好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>来自1999年的史料可是很珍贵的，你们应该懂得欣赏这些失落的未来艺术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我劝你们趁早习惯这些，不然等回到1999年，我们的审美可要严重落伍了哦～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>蓝图小姐怎么说？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>她拒绝评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我想也是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧，奥尔加奶奶最近身体还好吗？我都很久没收到你们的消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>她身体不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>在那次“暴雨”之后，基金会就将我们作为“暴雨”知情人士接进了各个分部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>奥尔加会在一些需要协调和沟通当地群众的事务上帮忙，不过其他人就只能多少帮点体力活了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>孩子们都很健康，这儿的伙食比在诺瓦米奇的时候也好上不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那我就放心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我听说你在巴塞罗那有了一段非常奇妙的遭遇，甚至拉普拉斯侧都对这段有关意识唤醒者的轶事非常感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>今天晚上我们可以一边吃东西一边讲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>等到明天，我就又要坐飞机去其他地方了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>听上去你还是很忙碌，虽然现在基金会的建筑委托应该基本都停摆了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你的消息还是一如既往地灵通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧，我打算前往世界各地，将值得记录的……甚至只在这个时代出现的建筑们归档记录下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>除了对我来说是一段绝佳的学习机会之外，我想或许也会有其他“不可回溯地”被我撞见呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我们通常称这为“瞎猫撞见死耗子”调查法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>姗姗来迟的监工像发牌一样毫不客气地给每个人塞了一张薄薄的纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>访客登记，谁都别想逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们好不容易聚会一次，你的第一反应是催我们填这些又臭又长的表格吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>所以？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>不过……你的想法倒是确实不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图点了点头，然后随手拿起了回声谣和小洪扎的那份，开始帮不知访客登记表为何物的二人填起了基本信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>外面的时代确实在“倒退”。仅从目前的“暴雨”规律来看是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>或许有一天……你钟爱的那些粗野主义代表建筑会变得越来越新。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>直到彻底消失吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>嗯……我不是很理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>事物不应该是变得越来越旧，直到消失吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>在“暴雨”中不是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>好吧，看样子这个世界终于不满足于只杀死老人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>旧的要老死，太新的会被淋死，这就是我们如今的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>听上去充满了挑战，或许这是一个更适合中年人生存的世界？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只有言行像中年人的不算吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……我不知道你的话在暗指什么，但根据基金会的条例，未完成访客登记审查的人进入大厅外区域算非法入侵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>包括餐厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人叽叽喳喳地伏在一张圆桌上和访客登记表鏖战着，路过的职员们来去匆匆，带起了一阵风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本放置在桌上的海报被掀起，轻轻地飘落在不远处的地面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浮夸的艺术字被漫上地板的阳光照亮，像是一轮真正的虹光。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我其实很害怕坐飞机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>每当飞机盘旋，作出转向的动作而微微偏离水平线的时候，我都觉得下一秒我们要倾覆着坠向地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>舷窗外的天空因角度变化而消失，我们被迫开始俯瞰整座城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但那时，我忘记了恐惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>因为那是由无数工人一砖一瓦堆叠起来的建筑群，那里面也不乏我这样的建筑师投入了心血的规划与验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>最终，它们汇成一张由光编织成的网，就像我在诺瓦米奇看到的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>现代城市规划总是要面对一点，那就是自然在城市的退却。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们不得不种满散播光污染的路灯和霓虹……人们不再能看到古老而美丽的星星。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_8_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_8_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_8_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但，那次的夜晚航行告诉我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或许星星一直都在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只是我们将它们摘下，种在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>——天上的人们在夜晚看向我们的城市，也会觉得那是另一片美丽的星空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就这样看着我们吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……所有我爱的人儿啊。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "再会在新世界-08"}}